{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and motion capabilities, including open-loop motion pulses and sensor events. The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: forward/random_walk in clear, rotate to escape side obstacles, move_backward for front obstacles, and full_rotate only as last-resort. Recovery states are one-shot and return to exploration as soon as path is clear. No oscillation or unsafe action is enabled. All uncontrollable events are handled in every state.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception (sensors) and motion (actuators)",
    "Specification automaton binds sensor outcomes to safe, coverage-biased actions, enforcing recovery and exploration alternation"
  ],
